bound-lock/1 about="The six unmounted read-only catalog entries have no current product imports or render selection and were retired; separately selected historical artifact bindings remain intact. CI tests the installed host boundaries, current reading identity and package build without local draft inputs. Whole-repository self-closure is not a product test or a paid release verdict: it remains an explicit unpaid demand until its worlds have public verified deliveries and current portable receipts. No numeric ceiling, authority check, executable-closure check or historical receipt identity is changed." at=policy:bound/019-minimum-ci-scope by=target form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=rationale/019/minimum-ci-scope value=present
