bound-lock/1 about="The supplemental quartet executes the native instrument on two formed positive places and one formed same-epoch-order refusal. Original negative input data remain delivered. Exact descriptor bytes and native execution receipts are required; this projection does not authenticate arbitrary histories." at=witness:executable-publication-additions by=target form=alphabet measure=status needs=docs/contracts/engine-object-projection.publication.json|docs/contracts/engine.md|samples/engine-alphabet/TARGET.bound|samples/engine-interval/TARGET.bound|samples/no/engine-alphabet.json|samples/no/engine-interval.json|samples/no/engine-order/TARGET.bound|samples/no/engine-order/inputs/sample.json|vectors/engine-object.cli.json role=demands scope=contract/published/engine-object-projection value=present
